ú
Definitions

Company Name    An optional name that includes any combination of up
                to 59 alphanumeric characters indicating the company's
                name.

                ş  You can use other symbols or punctuation; however
                   you cannot use the dollar sign, $.

                ş  You can use reserved words in this statement.
ú
Use
There are two ways to enter the company name.

ş    Use the declaration segment form, select the Company field, and
     type the name.

ş    Type the company name after the author statement and before the
     date in the PDS file using a text editor.

The following error conditions pertain to the company statement.

ş    Without a company statement, a warning is issued and processing
     continues.

ş    With multiple company statements, an error is reported and
     processing stops.
